# Validates a nested ts_config whose nearest package.json is in a Bazel package
# with js_tsconfig_package_deps disabled: app/ has a hand-written js_library
# carrying its package.json, under a name gazelle would not pick, so
# app/child's ts_config MUST depend on it. (Without such a library the child
# gets no dep; see tsconfig_package_deps_inherited.)
